4,0,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'm going to be a super-detective and find the werewolf for sure! Does anyone have a cool plan to start with? Hehe!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us start by simply observing one another. In my experience, rushing into a plan often leads to mistakes. A calm and patient approach is usually the most reliable.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with George. Maybe we should just... listen to each other for a bit. I'm not very good at these things, but I'll do my best to help.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a pleasure to be here with all of you. Rin, your energy is simply wonderful! I agree with George and Daisuke; let us be patient and kind as we get to know one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet everyone. I agree that we should start slowly and kindly. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to support you all and help us find the truth together.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're so calm! It's like you're a professional detective! But if we just listen, will we find any clues? Maybe we should ask everyone what they think a werewolf would do! Hehe, that sounds like a fun way to start!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"@Rin, while your enthusiasm is admirable, asking for a werewolf's tactics may only provide the wolf with a guide on how to deceive us. It is better to watch how people naturally behave under pressure.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think George is right. If we ask about tactics, it might... make it easier for the wolf to hide. I'm sorry, I just... I think we should be careful.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Daisuke, dear, there is no need to apologize. Your caution is a very thoughtful thing. I believe that by listening with an open heart, the truth will reveal itself in its own time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think Shizue is right. Let's try to create a comfortable space for everyone. If we are all honest and supportive, it might be easier to notice when something feels out of place. I'm looking forward to talking more.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, that's a great idea! A cozy space for everyone! But wait, if the werewolf is pretending to be super nice, they'll fit right in, right? Hehe! I'll keep my detective eyes open for any ""fake"" kindness!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, your vigilance is a necessary part of this game. However, we must be careful not to mistake genuine kindness for deception. Let us maintain our civility while remaining observant of any inconsistencies.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope we can all be honest. But Rin is right... it's scary to think that someone could be pretending. I'll try to pay attention, but I'm not sure if I'll notice anything.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is quite natural to feel a little frightened, Daisuke. We are all in this together, and we shall look after one another. Let us simply be our true selves; that is the most wonderful way to play.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, you're very sharp! It's true that we have to be careful, but I believe we can still be kind while staying alert. Let's just trust our instincts and support each other as we go.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to trust my instincts too! I'll be the most cheerful detective ever! I hope the Seer finds something super spooky tonight! Goodnight everyone, see you tomorrow! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,"I shall also retire for the evening. Let us all hope for a peaceful night and that the Seer's vision provides us with a clear path forward tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope everyone has a peaceful night too. I'll try to be more helpful tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been such a lovely first day. I shall wish you all a peaceful night's sleep and sweet dreams. Please take care of yourselves, and I look forward to seeing your smiling faces tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"It was a pleasure getting to know you all today. I hope we all have a restful night and that the Seer finds a helpful clue. Sleep well, everyone. See you tomorrow!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
