35,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning everyone! I'm awake and ready! Hehe! I wonder if the Seer found a big, scary wolf already? @everyone, does anyone feel like they're acting a little bit different today? I'm watching you all!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"Good morning, Rin. It is far too early to judge based on a feeling. Let us wait and see if the Seer is willing to share their findings or if any contradictions emerge in our conversation.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope the Seer found something helpful. But like George said, maybe we should wait. I'm still a bit nervous... does anyone have any thoughts they want to share?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept peacefully. It is a bit frightening to think of the wolf among us, but let us keep our hearts calm. I wonder if anyone has noticed anything unusual?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all feel rested. I agree with George and Daisuke; we should be patient. If the Seer feels it's safe to speak, we're all listening. Does anyone have any initial impressions?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're always so patient! But I'm too curious to wait! Hehe! @Daisuke, you're still nervous, are you? Maybe the wolf is trying to make you feel that way! Does anyone have a ""gut feeling"" yet?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"@Rin, gut feelings are often misleading. We must rely on evidence and logic to avoid making a mistake that could cost us an innocent life. Let us focus on the facts as they emerge.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, I... I don't think anyone is trying to make me feel this way. I'm just... naturally like this. I don't have a gut feeling, but I'm worried we might make a mistake if we rush.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Daisuke, dear, please do not let your heart be troubled. Your gentle nature is a gift, not a weakness. I believe we can find the truth together if we simply remain patient and supportive of one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, let's try not to tease Daisuke too much. Being nervous is perfectly normal in a game like this. I agree with George that logic is important, but I also think we should listen to how everyone is feeling.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I'm not teasing! I'm just being a detective! Hehe! But you're right, let's be nice to Daisuke. @everyone, if the Seer is here, maybe you can give us a tiny hint? Just a little one! I'm dying to know!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, pushing the Seer for hints is a dangerous game. A hint can be misinterpreted by the village or used by the wolf to identify the Seer. It is wiser to let the Seer decide when to speak.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with George. If the Seer is forced to speak too soon, it might... put them in danger. I'm sorry, but I think it's better to be safe. Does anyone else feel that way?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is so heartwarming to see how much you all care for the Seer's safety. George and Daisuke are quite right; we must be very mindful. Perhaps the truth will bloom more beautifully if we allow it its own time.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. Let's not pressure the Seer; their safety is our priority. Since we have no concrete information yet, maybe we should think about what we've observed in our conversations so far. Does anyone feel suspicious?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Hmm, no one wants to give a hint! You're all so serious! Hehe! But @Midori asked a big question! I don't know... everyone is being so nice, it's hard! Maybe the wolf is the one being the nicest? That's a super-detective thought! Who do you think?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"@Rin, that is a common theory, but it is a double-edged sword. If we suspect those who are kind, we risk destroying the very trust we need to survive. I find no one particularly suspicious yet. Let us vote with caution.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want to suspect anyone. Everyone has been so kind to me... but if we have to vote, I'm really scared of picking the wrong person. I'll just... follow what the group thinks is safest.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very heavy burden to choose someone, isn't it? My heart aches to think we might hurt an innocent soul. However, for the safety of our dear friends, I believe we must be brave. I shall share a secret... I am the Seer, and I have found that George is the werewolf.","{""words"":54,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, that is a very shocking revelation! I can't believe you've stepped forward like this. @George, this is a very serious claim. Do you have anything you would like to say in your defense before we decide?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
